        {
          "name": "Bounds Overlap Fn",
          "type": "TFunctionRef<bool ( FAxisAlignedBox3d& CellBounds )>"
        },
        {
          "name": "Object I Ds",
          "type": "TArray<int32>&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Collect ObjectIDs from all the leaf cells that have bounding boxes that pass BoundsOverlapFn\n@param RangeBoundsHint A box to potentially limit the iteration range across cells. Note that\nthis might be ignored if the allocation of cells is such that trying to check for cells in that\nrange would take more time than just iterating over all allocated cells.\n@param BoundsOverlapFn Must be thread-safe. Used to determine if the cell is part\nof the desired range.\n@param ObjectIDsOut collected ObjectIDs are stored here"
    },
    {
