        {
          "name": "Bounds Overlap Fn",
          "type": "TFunctionRef<bool ( FAxisAlignedBox3d& )>"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Int",
      "docs": "Find any overlap between a caller-defined query and any object ID. Returns the first overlap it finds.\n@param ShapeBounds Overall bounds of the custom query shape\n@param ObjectOverlapFn Custom function that indicates if the given ObjectID overlaps the query shape\n@param BoundsOverlapFn Optional custom function that indicates if the given bounding box overlaps the query shape, used to filter the octree search.\nNote the bounds overlap with ShapeBounds will already be called before calling this; only provide this if a more accurate overlap can be quickly checked.\n@return index of overlapping ObjectID or INDEX_NONE if no overlaps are found"
    },
